<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Package publishing — Elang</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_elang/assets/ui.css"><script src="/assets/integrations.js" defer></script></head><body><header class="product-header"><a class="product-brand" href="/admin">Elang</a><nav><a href="/admin">Content</a><a href="/security">Security</a><a href="/operations">Operations</a></nav></header><main class="wide-shell"><p class="eyebrow">ADMINISTRATOR / INTEGRATIONS</p><h1>Package publishing</h1><p>Connect your Packagist account after reviewing the prepared repositories. The API token is encrypted in private server storage and is never shown again.</p>{% if saved %}<p class="notice">Encrypted connection saved.</p>{% endif %}<section class="panel"><h2>Packagist connection</h2><p><a href="https://packagist.org/profile/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open Packagist profile</a></p><p>Use the main API token for package creation. Do not send it through chat.</p><form class="stack" method="post" action="/admin/integrations/packagist"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ token }}"><label>Packagist username<input name="username" value="{{ settings.username }}" required maxlength="80" autocomplete="username"></label><label>Main API token<input name="api_token" type="password" required autocomplete="off" minlength="16" maxlength="512"></label><label>Current account password<input name="current_password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label><button class="button">Save encrypted connection</button></form></section><section class="panel"><h2>Prepared repositories</h2><p>Submission starts Packagist indexing. It does not by itself prove that a package version is available.</p><div data-packagist-publisher data-token="{{ token }}">{% if packages %}<button class="button" data-publish-all{% if not settings.configured %} disabled{% endif %}>Submit all prepared packages</button><p role="status" data-publish-all-status></p>{% endif %}{% for package in packages %}<div class="list-row"><div><strong>{{ package.name }}</strong><p><a href="{{ package.repository }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{{ package.repository }}</a></p><code>{{ package.commit }}</code><p role="status" data-publish-status></p></div><button class="button secondary" data-publish-package="{{ package.name }}"{% if not settings.configured %} disabled{% endif %}>Submit package</button></div>{% else %}<p>Prepared repositories will appear after release checks pass.</p>{% endfor %}</div></section></main></body></html>
